482Xf0jTPfLiR6qXlLYK.jpg"},{"id":6818,"name":"Werner Herzog","original_name":"Werner Herzog","job":"Writer","department":"Writing","gender":2,"profile_path":"/qKlz1oM482Xf0jTPfLiR6qXlLYK.jpg"},{"id":49501,"name":"Florian Fricke","original_name":"Florian Fricke","job":"Music","department":"Sound","gender":2,"profile_path":"/qa5a0Q28i8wnHbz9KUv2ykAuAr6.jpg"},{"id":2153929,"name":"Renate Knaup","original_name":"Renate Knaup","job":"Music","department":"Sound","gender":0,"profile_path":null},{"id":5817968,"name":"Daniel Fichelscher","original_name":"Daniel Fichelscher","job":"Music","department":"Sound","gender":0,"profile_path":null}]},"alternativeTitles":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","title":"The Dark Glow Of The Mountains","type":""}],"externalIds":{"imdb_id":"tt0087317","wikidata_id":"Q3758609","facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"keywords":[{"id":1262,"name":"mountain"},{"id":3541,"name":"afghanistan"},{"id":8624,"name":"climbing"},{"id":160177,"name":"mountaineering"}],"releaseDates":[{"iso_3166_1":"DE","release_dates":[{"certification":"6","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"de","note":"","release_date":"1985-06-23T00:00:00.000Z","type":6}]},{"iso_3166_1":"IT","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1985-03-09T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"","overview":"„Gasherbrum - Der leuchtende Berg“: Für dieses Dokumentarfilm-Projekt haben sich zwei Extremisten, Brüder im Geiste, gesucht und gefunden. Die Münchner Autorenfilmer-Legende Werner Herzog begleitete Reinhold Messner, den wohl besten Bergsteiger aller Zeiten, im Sommer 1984 auf einer wahnwitzigen Expedition. Gemeinsam mit seinem Landsmann Hans Kammerlander wollte der Südtiroler das schaffen, was zuvor noch niemand gewagt hatte: die Besteigung von zwei Achttausendern als Überquerung direkt hintereinander.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"it","iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italiano","english_name":"Italian","title":"Gasherbrum - La montagna lucente","overview":"Il regista documenta la spedizione italiana di Reinhold Messner e Hans Kammerlander ai Gasherbrum I e II avvenuta nel 1984. Scopo della spedizione era la traversata in stile alpino delle due vette, impresa mai realizzata fino ad allora. Il film documenta le fasi di avvicinamento, la permanenza al campo base, la partenza per la vetta, il ritorno dalla vetta ed il periodo successivo, focalizzandosi, più che sugli aspetti tecnici, sugli aspetti psicologici dei due alpinisti, in particolare di Reinhold Messner.\r Messner, che perse un fratello nel 1970 sul Nanga Parbat, parla tra le altre anche di questa esperienza, e rimane particolarmente turbato quando Herzog gli rivolge una domanda diretta sull'accaduto. Si tratta principalmente di un film intervista, intervallato da riprese delle montagne del Karakorum.\r Le riprese della traversata, svoltasi in parte in condizioni di maltempo, sono state realizzate dallo stesso Messner","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"The Dark Glow of the Mountains","overview":"Werner Herzog follows mountaineers Hans Kammerlander and Reinhold Messner during their expedition into climbing the Gasherbrum mountains, which has some of the most difficult peaks to be conquered, and they'll do it without the use of oxygen tanks. Herzog also takes some time to hear about their past experiences with other mountains, their personal tragedies and the reasons why they are so involved with such activity.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"Gasherbrum, la montagne lumineuse","overview":"Les alpinistes Reinhold Messner et Hans Kammerlander, entreprennent l'ascension de deux sommets de l'Himalaya culminant à 8000 mètres, d'une seule traite, sans camp fixe, sans radio ni oxygène. Messner a déjà gravi ces deux sommets, mais les enchaîner ainsi, sans retour au camp de base, serait un exploit inédit.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"","overview":"En el verano de 1984, el famoso alpinista Reinhold Messner emprendió en Pakistán la ascensión a dos cimas del Karakorum en compañía del joven Hans Kammenlander. El reto era coronar las dos cumbres en siete días, de modo ininterrumpido, sin oxígeno, sin sofisticados equipos y sin descender al campamento base. Herzog rodó las dudas íntimas de los montañeros y la belleza del inútil esfuerzo humano.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"加舒尔布鲁木峰：光之山","overview":"维尔纳·赫尔佐格跟随登山家汉斯·卡默兰德和莱因霍尔德·梅斯纳尔踏上征服加舒尔布鲁姆群峰的探险之旅。这些山峰攀登难度极高，而他们将全程不使用氧气瓶完成挑战。赫尔佐格还深入探寻了两位登山家过往的攀登经历、各自遭遇的人生悲剧，以及他们如此执着于这项极限运动的深层原因。","tagline":""}],"videos":[],"images":{"posters":[{"file_path":"/k1DXDLJ2xyNdqAog9QtcpYUfEIj.jpg","width":501,"height":751,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/h8ISYTosbDEYNEgml7lPhbr8Etw.jpg","width":1280,"height":1920,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/78ZiNh9DyjZ1ZHOl4pkqh5e9KWE.jpg","width":718,"height":1000,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":0.166,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/e3hMHdWfFI1PfNHWjjMQjSXRqK7.jpg","width":1280,"height":1920,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0.166,"vote_count":1}],"backdrops":[{"file_path":"/jigM91a1Q4fj7wjDoI7Bd1hvvCY.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/xiFzsiB6HPxmdTIzL6o4kEeRnpQ.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0}],"logos":[]},"recommendations":[{"id":890825,"title":"14 x 8000 : Aux sommets de l'impossible","original_title":"14 Peaks: Nothing Is Impossible","release_date":"2021-11-12","poster_path":"/iJ4kJGqcmHYvvotC7OUlUfs7Abj.jpg","vote_average":7.323,"genre_ids":[99],"original_language":"en"},{"id":21736,"title":"Everest","original_title":"Everes